OL,3,APope diagnosed with lung cancer but had
OL,4,Asuccessful surgery, Vatican says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe lump was first detected during what
OL,7,Fthe Vatican has described as "routine
OL,8,Fchecks". The Pope is expected to remain
OL,9,Fin hospital for about a week.
